      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://swmichigan.org/plan-and-stay/towns/three-oaks"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Warren Featherbone Factory, built over a century ago, once stripped turkey feathers for corsets and now houses Journeyman Distillery and Acorn Theater.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three_Oaks%2C_Michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Journeyman Distillery, located in the restored Featherbone building, crafts certified organic spirits like whiskey, gin, rum, and vodka.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://swmichigan.org/plan-and-stay/towns/three-oaks"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Dewey Cannon Park hosts Music in the Park, where regional musicians play under the historic Spanish‑American War cannon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        21,
